1:["$","main",null,{"id":"main-content","children":[["$","header",null,{"className":"page-hero","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"shell article-header","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow light","children":"Getting Started"}],["$","h1",null,{"children":"How Online Quran Classes Work: A Beginner's Guide"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"page-hero-copy","children":"Understand how one-to-one online Quran lessons are scheduled, taught and supported before booking your first class."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-meta","children":[["$","time",null,{"dateTime":"2026-08-28","children":["Published ","August 28, 2026"]}],["$","span",null,{"children":"6 min read"}]]}]]}]}],["$","$Ld",null,{"items":[{"name":"Home","href":"/"},{"name":"Blog","href":"/blog/"},{"name":"How Online Quran Classes Work: A Beginner's Guide"}]}],["$","article",null,{"className":"section section-paper","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"shell article-body","children":[[["$","section","A simple way to learn from home",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"A simple way to learn from home"}],[["$","p","Online Quran classes connect a learner and tutor in a live video lesson. The teacher listens, demonstrates pronunciation and corrects the learner in real time. A private format also allows the lesson to stay focused on the student's current level.",{"children":"Online Quran classes connect a learner and tutor in a live video lesson. The teacher listens, demonstrates pronunciation and corrects the learner in real time. A private format also allows the lesson to stay focused on the student's current level."}],["$","p","Most learners only need a stable internet connection, a phone, tablet or computer, headphones when helpful, and a quiet place to read. The learning material depends on the program and may include a Qaida, a mushaf and teacher-prepared practice notes.",{"children":"Most learners only need a stable internet connection, a phone, tablet or computer, headphones when helpful, and a quiet place to read. The learning material depends on the program and may include a Qaida, a mushaf and teacher-prepared practice notes."}]]]}],["$","section","What happens before regular lessons begin?",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"What happens before regular lessons begin?"}],[["$","p","A useful first step is a short assessment. The tutor or coordinator can listen to the learner, discuss goals and recommend a suitable starting point. Beginners may begin with letter recognition, while experienced readers may focus on fluency, Tajweed or memorization.",{"children":"A useful first step is a short assessment. The tutor or coordinator can listen to the learner, discuss goals and recommend a suitable starting point. Beginners may begin with letter recognition, while experienced readers may focus on fluency, Tajweed or memorization."}],["$","p","Families should also discuss preferred days, local time zone, lesson length and tutor preference. Clear expectations at the start make it easier to maintain a consistent routine.",{"children":"Families should also discuss preferred days, local time zone, lesson length and tutor preference. Clear expectations at the start make it easier to maintain a consistent routine."}]]]}],["$","section","How to make online learning effective",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"How to make online learning effective"}],[["$","p","Consistency matters more than unusually long sessions. A manageable timetable, brief practice between lessons and a quiet learning space usually support better progress than irregular study.",{"children":"Consistency matters more than unusually long sessions. A manageable timetable, brief practice between lessons and a quiet learning space usually support better progress than irregular study."}],"$Le"]]}]],"$Lf"]}]}],"$L10","$L11"]}]
